H, Forbes J, Thuerlimann B, Paridaens R, Gelber R, Castiglione-Gertsch M, Goldhirsch A (2006) Predictors of early recurrence in postmenopausal women with hormone receptor positive breast cancer in the BIG 1&#x02013;98 trial. Eur J Cancer Suppl 4:111. Abstract 219 </citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn><p>With valuable contributions from Hilary Chaudri Ross, Henning T. Mouridsen, and Patrick Trunet.</p></fn><fn><p>An erratum to this article can be found at 						<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s10549-007-9853-8">http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s10549-007-9853-8</ext-link></p></fn></fn-group></back></article>